</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Singing songs together,</l><l>Spirits exercised.</l><l>Drawing from each other,</l><l>Christ is realized!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Reading in the Bible,</l><l>Each one taking turns;</l><l>Fellowship together,</l><l>How our spirit burns!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Praying for our loved ones,</l><l>Bring them to the throne.</l><l>Christ desires to save them,</l><l>Bringing them all home!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Morning, noon and evening,</l><l>Gath’ring with the saints;</l><l>Joy in each one’s presence,</l><l>Taking in fresh grace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
